Worker Code is an original bounded runtime adapter for Pi Durable. Its
runtime-neutral execution coordinator and nested dispatcher are compiled
from the internal packages/execution source tree. See that directory's NOTICE
for notices for its shared output and execution contracts.

Shared execution contracts are adapted from @howaboua/pi-codex-conversion,
revision b2006db9def12c373ae48e70044d30f7d6b7e34f.
Source: https://github.com/IgorWarzocha/howaboua-pi-stuff
Shared output retention derives from Pi Durable revision
f5d20047b3ad43d068a8eb61bd4e1f193bedbce6.
Modifications: Durable-native execution ownership, bounded Worker runtime,
ordinary-tool dispatch and cancellation cleanup.

